WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit in Lotus or a steady cross-legged seat with hands beside the hips.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Spread the fingers and press firmly into the floor.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Engage the belly and lift the hips and legs off the mat.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Gaze soft and steady; keep the chest lifted.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold briefly, then lower with control and rest the wrists.
